</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate the Frozen VAE in two variants: one conditioned on sparse depth and one on
pre‑completed depth. Pre‑completion is performed using the same barycentric interpolation
tested earlier under varying sparsity. Results in Tab. <a href="#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 4.5 Ablation Study on Fusion Strategies ‣ 4 Experiments and Results ‣ Need for Speed: Zero-Shot Depth Completion with Single-Step Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>
show that all early-fusion models perform on average worse than our late‑fusion approach.</p>
</div>
